## Key Concepts

- Cloud Functions triggers on Cloud Storage object finalize
- Schema validation and per-tenant data routing
- PII redaction driven by a policies.json file
- BigQuery partitioning by tenant and date
- Idempotent writes using insertId
- Minimal IAM bindings and simple error handling

